      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Plimoth Patuxet, a living history museum south of Plymouth Center, recreates the 17th‑century Pilgrim settlement and includes the Mayflower II replica ship.",
